<title>UK: Bank of England details UK gilt conversion.</title>
<headline>Bank of England details UK gilt conversion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said 1.15 billion stg, or 92.4 percent, of a 1.25 billion stg 13-1/2 pct Treasury stock due 2004-2008 had been converted into 8-1/2 percent Treasury stock due 2005.</p>
<p>The amount of 8-1/2 percent 2005 stock outstanding following the conversion is 10.37 billion stg.</p>
<p>The amount of 13-1/2 percent 2004-2008 stock remaining is 95.47 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
